(7321711, 1142801, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very fun!  LOVE the top of the head being the base.   And the expression and the hands on his "head".   The characters... well... something''s not right....<br/> <br/>I think it''s the one with his head in the upper right corner... stepping off into nothing instead of "fighting the edges" as the others are doing (except for the one who is falling and can''t fight the edges).   The others all look like gravity is working against them (as it naturally does), but with him... it doesn''t seem to work.<br/> <br/>When I hold my hand over that guy, I give this a 10.  When I take my hand away, I give this a 9.   <br/> <br/>I have to take my hand away to vote... so... 9 it is.   <br/> <br/>Well done.  The colors are so wonderful, too!</td>', 'Very fun!  LOVE the top of the head being the base.   And the expression and the hands on his "head".   The characters... well... something''s not right.... I think it''s the one with his head in the upper right corner... stepping off into nothing instead of "fighting the edges" as the others are doing (except for the one who is falling and can''t fight the edges).   The others all look like gravity is working against them (as it naturally does), but with him... it doesn''t seem to work. When I hold my hand over that guy, I give this a 10.  When I take my hand away, I give this a 9.    I have to take my hand away to vote... so... 9 it is.    Well done.  The colors are so wonderful, too!', '2015-02-27 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
