(7323132, 1142801, 135744, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great finish for a superb entry. Ah yes I know that concept all too well - have spent many hours trying to master various musical instruments with no success. Time wasted or not?! Anyway sorry to hear about your frustration with this one. Your creations are very time consuming and I am always amazed how you can turn these around within 7 days especially with a young child and a job too. Thanks as always for the background info.</td>', 'Congrats on a great finish for a superb entry. Ah yes I know that concept all too well - have spent many hours trying to master various musical instruments with no success. Time wasted or not?! Anyway sorry to hear about your frustration with this one. Your creations are very time consuming and I am always amazed how you can turn these around within 7 days especially with a young child and a job too. Thanks as always for the background info.', '2015-03-04 01:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7323137, 1142790, 30490, '<td valign="top">The cross eyed cat with the tongue out in concentration is just too funny for words! Very creative and interesting image, nice job on this one!</td>', 'The cross eyed cat with the tongue out in concentration is just too funny for words! Very creative and interesting image, nice job on this one!', '2015-03-04 02:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
