(7323649, 1142801, 100393, '<td valign="top">The brow furrow/thread is pure genius. The pov/perspective on you is unusual and highly effective.<br/> <br/>Great concept and much better executed than you would have us believe!<br/> <br/>I never tire of seeing inside your head and this time we are able to do that quite literally!</td>', 'The brow furrow/thread is pure genius. The pov/perspective on you is unusual and highly effective. Great concept and much better executed than you would have us believe! I never tire of seeing inside your head and this time we are able to do that quite literally!', '2015-03-05 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
