(7324606, 1142559, 22538, '<td valign="top">Congrats and keep going, do what you do and it''s fabulous. You inject originality and some real thinking with your work in here. As for the shot, I bet you at least toyed with the possibility of replacing either of the models with a male one. Even if it proved a bombshell too much to bear (negative scores are impossible though...).</td>', 'Congrats and keep going, do what you do and it''s fabulous. You inject originality and some real thinking with your work in here. As for the shot, I bet you at least toyed with the possibility of replacing either of the models with a male one. Even if it proved a bombshell too much to bear (negative scores are impossible though...).', '2015-03-07 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
